.TH ckman-config-admin-pin 1  ckman 
.SH NAME
ckman\-config\-admin\-pin \- Manage the device Admin PIN
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBckman\-config\-admin\-pin\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage the device Admin PIN
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
